# Never commit game data or anything derived from a disc (CLAUDE.md "Assets and discs"), in a game's code, tools
# or workspace: it lives in the data folder (tools/paths.env's ZAXIS_DATA), linked into the workspaces by
# tools/setup/setup.sh (the links: the root's .gitignore). tools/.gitignore the same.
*.iso
*.bin
*.elf
*.ELF
*.irx
*.IRX
*.nvm
*.mec
*.ps2
*.pss
*.PSS
*-decomp.c
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
imgui.ini
